cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OSMSS, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OSMSS (One Stop MS Shop)"
abstract: >-
  OSMSS is a no-code R Shiny application for the statistical analysis and
  interpretation of quantitative proteomics data. It reads search results from
  Proteome Discoverer, MaxQuant, FragPipe, DIA-NN and Spectronaut, records the
  experimental design through a short wizard, selects the analysis route,
  runs established statistical methods (proDA, limma, SAINTexpress) and writes
  a case-specific methods text for every analysis.
